   "text": "# sackview\n\nSee what\u2019s inside a ZIP archive before you unpack it. Each entry shows its name, compressed size, and unpacked size.\n\n## Install\n\n```sh\npipx install sackview\n```\n\n## Inspect an archive\n\nList the archive\u2019s entries and check the total unpacked size against your available disk space before extracting elsewhere.\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip\n```\n\n### Show the largest entries\n\nShow the ten entries with the largest unpacked sizes, largest first.\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip --largest 10\n```\n\n### Find entries by name\n\nShow only entries whose names match a pattern.\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip --find '*.csv'\n```\n\n## Your archive stays unchanged\n\nsackview never extracts entries or changes the archive. Inspection works offline and sends no archive contents to a service.\n\n## Supported format\n\nsackview supports ZIP archives only. Other archive formats produce an unsupported-format message and return exit code `24`.",
